SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 95 taxa with 4 partitions and 16554 total sites (0% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	95	1108	127	72	976	976	control_region
   2	DNA	95	7801	163	77	7612	7612	rRNA+tRNA+cds_pos1
   3	DNA	95	3780	47	9	3736	3736	cds_pos2
   4	DNA	95	3865	194	93	3614	3614	cds_pos3+noncoding_other

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

ModelFinder
-----------

Best-fit model according to BIC: K3Pu+F+R3:control_region,TN+F+I:rRNA+tRNA+cds_pos1,HKY+F+I:cds_pos2,TIM2+F+G4:cds_pos3+noncoding_other

List of best-fit models per partition:

  ID  Model                  LogL         AIC      w-AIC        AICc     w-AICc         BIC      w-BIC
   1  K3Pu+F+R3         -3156.126    6332.252 - 6.4e-310    6332.452 - 6.95e-310    6382.355 - 2.96e-323
   2  TN+F+I           -12644.389   25302.778 - 6.4e-310   25302.793 - 6.95e-310   25351.512 - 2.96e-323
   3  HKY+F+I           -5404.443   10820.885 - 6.4e-310   10820.908 - 6.95e-310   10858.310 - 2.96e-323
   4  TIM2+F+G4         -6727.251   13470.502 - 6.4e-310   13470.539 - 6.95e-310   13520.580 - 2.96e-323

AIC, w-AIC   : Akaike information criterion scores and weights.
AICc, w-AICc : Corrected AIC scores and weights.
BIC, w-BIC   : Bayesian information criterion scores and weights.

Plus signs denote the 95% confidence sets.
Minus signs denote significant exclusion.

